This is my very first data analysis model to analyze the survival rate of the passengers of titanic.
I've implemened very basic teachniques. I followed the following process:
1. Data cleaning
    - Filled each missing age with median of it's pclass
    - handled the missing values

2. Explanatory Data Analysis
    - Survivors vs non-Survivors
    - Age vs survival
    - Sex vs survival
    - class vs survival
    - fare vs survival

3. Data Visualization
    Visualized the analyzed data in EDA in four different charts

